# {{context|music|lang=en}} A [[dissonant]] music [[note]]. Used in [[Baroque]] music as a decorative embellishment of a melodic note. The grace note is played as quickly as possible and takes no time from the melody note. The symbol for this grace note is a smaller quaver with a line through.

